<apex:component controller="EndorsementDocuments_Ctrl">
    <apex:stylesheet value="{!$Resource.PolicyDocumentsCSS}" />
    <apex:attribute name="recordIdParam" description="" type="String" assignTo="{!recordId}" />
    <p class="heading"> 
        Disciplinary Proceedings Coverage Endorsement
    </p>
    <p class="normalParagraph">
        It is agreed that <span class="boldSpan">II. SUPPLEMENTARY PAYMENTS, B.</span> is deleted and replaced with the following:
    </p>
    <table border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="width:100%">
        <tr>
            <td style="width:5%;" class="tableDataLeft">
                <p class="normalParagraph">
                    <span class="boldSpan">B.</span>
                </p>
            </td>
            <td style="width:95%;" class="tableDataLeft">
                <p class="normalParagraph">
                    The <span class="boldSpan">COMPANY</span> will pay legal fees, costs, and expenses (collectively “Disciplinary Fees”) up to &nbsp;<apex:outputField value="{!endorsement.PER_LAWER__c}"/> &nbsp;<apex:outputField value="{!endorsement.Policy_Firm__c}"/>&nbsp; per <span class="boldSpan">INSURED</span> lawyer per <span class="boldSpan">POLICY TERM</span> and &nbsp;<apex:outputField value="{!endorsement.PER_POLICY__c}"/>&nbsp; as the total available for all <span class="boldSpan">INSUREDs</span> per <span class="boldSpan">POLICY TERM</span> for a lawyer designated by <span class="boldSpan">US</span> to investigate and defend <span class="boldSpan">DISCIPLINARY PROCEEDINGS.</span> The <span class="boldSpan">DISCIPLINARY PROCEEDINGS</span> must be reported during the <span class="boldSpan">POLICY TERM</span> and brought against the <span class="boldSpan">INSURED</span> by reason of any act, error, omission or <span class="boldSpan">PERSONAL INJURY</span> occurring on or after the <span class="boldSpan">PRIOR ACTS DATE</span> and arising out of <span class="boldSpan">PROFESSIONAL SERVICES</span> provided that:<br/><br/>
                    <ol>
                        <li>
                            <p class="normalParagraph">
                                notice of the <span class="boldSpan">DISCIPLINARY PROCEEDINGS</span> must be reported in writing to and received by the <span class="boldSpan">COMPANY</span> during the <span class="boldSpan">POLICY TERM</span> and prior to any response by the <span class="boldSpan">INSURED</span> to the <span class="boldSpan">DISCIPLINARY PROCEEDINGS;</span>
                            </p>
                        </li>
                         <li>
                            <p class="normalParagraph">
                                by requesting that the <span class="boldSpan">COMPANY</span> investigate and defend <span class="boldSpan">DISCIPLINARY PROCEEDINGS,</span> the <span class="boldSpan">INSURED</span> is not reporting a <span class="boldSpan">CLAIM,</span> unless the <span class="boldSpan">INSURED</span> reports to the <span class="boldSpan">COMPANY</span> in accordance with <span class="boldSpan">V. CONDITIONS, O.</span> of this Policy;
                            </p>
                        </li>
                         <li>
                            <p class="normalParagraph">
                                disciplinary Fees above &nbsp;<apex:outputField value="{!endorsement.PER_LAWER__c}"/>&nbsp; are on a reimbursement basis and reimbursement to the <span class="boldSpan">NAMED INSURED</span> is conditioned upon a determination of Not To Proceed against the <span class="boldSpan">INSURED</span> against whom the <span class="boldSpan">DISCIPLINARY PROCEEDINGS</span> have been brought.  Not To Proceed means a final determination by the regulatory or disciplinary agency or official not to further investigate and no action has or will be taken against the <span class="boldSpan">INSURED</span> including but not limited to suspension, probation, censure, license revocation, reprimand, disbarment, or settlement; and
                            </p>
                        </li>
                         <li>
                            <p class="normalParagraph">
                                <span class="boldSpan">OUR</span> determination as to the reasonableness of Disciplinary Fees will be conclusive.
                            </p>
                        </li>
                    </ol>
                </p>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>
    <div style="clear:both;">
    </div>
    <br/>
    <br/>
    <p class="normalParagraph">
        All other terms, conditions, limitations and exclusions of the Policy to which this endorsement is attached remain unchanged.
    </p>
    <table border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="width:30%;margin-top:30px;" align="right">
        <tr>
            <td class="tableDataLeft">
                <apex:image url="{!$Resource.Authorised_Signature }" width="150" height="50"/>
                <br/>
                Authorized Representative
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>
</apex:component>